  "story": {
    "day": 98,
    "title": "Kaya's Busy Wednesday",
    "sentences": [
      "Kaya got up early on Wednesday, June twelfth.",
      "She quickly got out of bed.",
      "She remembered a lovely New Year's Day at elementary school.",
      "Then, young friends would skate a mile to a fun place.",
      "Kaya needed to be careful with her long hair.",
      "Her aunt's fortieth birthday was on June twenty-second.",
      "Kaya would bring a video for everybody.",
      "She took a bus. She would get off near the ski mountain.",
      "Kaya would get to the post office and finish.",
      "She bought beef, olive oil, and a different towel at the supermarket.",
      "Kaya did not worry. \"Sorry, no table tennis!\"",
      "Later, she would call her friend. She saw a cat's tail."
    ]
  }
